                                                "sense_id": "e9afd0e0-cc45-3563-aac2-dfcea7691f99",
                                                "text": "Toasting over a record does more than change the way that record is perceived by the audience: it creates a new piece of music with joint creative authorship, although the law does not support this characterization."
